 review focusing on enteral nutrition support and the use of diabetes-specific formulas for patients with diabetes.)<|COMPLETE|>", "HOSPITAL CLÍNICO \"LOZANO BLESA\":Hospital Clínico \"Lozano Blesa\" is a medical facility in Zaragoza where Dr. Fernando L. Calvo Gracia works, specializing in endocrinology and nutrition.", "TROMBOSIS PORTAL:Trombosis portal es una complicación que puede presentarse en pacientes con enfermedades hepáticas. Esta condición se caracteriza por la formación de un coágulo en la vena porta, lo que puede dar lugar a complicaciones adicionales, como la encefalopatía hepática. La trombosis portal está estrechamente relacionada con el estado de salud hepático del paciente, lo que resalta la importancia de un manejo adecuado de las enfermedades del hígado para prevenir esta complicación.", "URGENTES:Urgent care visit for bilateral lumbar pain with ureteral irradiation and urinary symptoms without fever on 17/5/97", "CIPROFLOXACINO:Ciprofloxacino is a specific quinolone antibiotic primarily used to treat various bacterial infections, including urinary tract infections and acute diarrhea. It is recognized as a basic medication, and its absorption can be enhanced in higher pH conditions, which may be influenced by food intake. Ciprofloxacino is primarily absorbed in the upper digestive tract; however, its absorption can be compromised when administered through a jejunostomy. Additionally, it is utilized in severe cases of inflammatory bowel disease to improve prognosis in situations such as perforation.", "CARCINOMA INDIFERENCIADO METASTÁSICO DE HÍGADO:Undifferentiated metastatic liver carcinoma of probable endocrine origin diagnosed after biopsy", "DTIC:DTIC, also known as Dacarbazine, is a chemotherapy drug utilized in the treatment regimen for patients with cancer. It was initiated as a treatment on February 6, 1998.", "GAMMAGRAFÍA CON OCTREÓTIDO:Octreotide scan that showed positive uptake in the head of the pancreas", "DUODENOPANCREATECTOMÍA TOTAL:Total duodenopancreatectomy performed on 05/02/1999", "CARCINOMA DE PÁNCREAS ENDOCRINO:Endocrine pancreatic carcinoma diagnosed post-surgery", "HCD:The right upper quadrant of the abdomen where the patient experienced pain", "BILIRRUBINA:Bilirrubina is a substance produced from the breakdown of red blood cells. It plays a crucial role in assessing liver function and hemolysis, as its levels are indicative of these processes. Total bilirubin levels are routinely monitored as part of liver function tests to evaluate the health of the liver and detect any potential issues related to red blood cell breakdown."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}